# _freeze/ is deliberately absent. In the freeze-based publishing workflow, CI
# needs the frozen results and the directory must stay committed.
#
# *_files/ is also deliberately absent. Quarto writes <doc>_files/ beside a
# standalone render, and the pattern cannot be anchored, so it collides the
# same way *_cache/ does. Add it per repo if this repo has no such conflict.
